---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="Patent — Xtruder Tools">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="bg-slate-950 pt-32 pb-14 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-brand text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-white font-heading text-4xl font-bold">Virtual Patent Marking Notice</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 mt-3 text-sm">Xtruder Tools AB</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">

      <p>The following products are protected by patents in the U.S. and elsewhere for Xtruder Tools AB. This page is provided to satisfy the virtual patent marking provisions of various jurisdictions, including the provisions of the America Invents Act and 35 U.S.C. §287(a).</p>
      <p>The following list of products and patents may not be all-inclusive. Some products may be covered by additional patents not listed here, and other products not listed may also be protected by one or more patents in the United States or elsewhere.</p>

      <hr class="border-slate-200" />

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">The Xtruder™</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mb-6">Device and method for coating a circular-cylindrical object</p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4">
            <span class="text-brand font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">US</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm">US Patent</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">US11857996B2</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4">
            <span class="text-brand font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">CA</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm">CA Patent</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">CA3180855A1</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4">
            <span class="text-brand font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">EP</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm">EPO Patent</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">EP4161707A4</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4">
            <span class="text-brand font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">WO</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm">WIPO Patent</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">WO2021246952A1</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4">
            <span class="text-brand font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">SE</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm">SWE Patent</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">SE544154C2</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-slate-200" />

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Questions?</h2>
        <p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@xtrudertools.com" class="text-brand hover:underline">support@xtrudertools.com</a> — we'll gladly talk to you.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
